prompts.content:
## Form
- Style: {{var:style}}
- The world: {{var:difficulty}}
- Intimate scenes: {{var:nsfw}}
{{#if author != "off"}}
- Author's lens: below, it tints the style.
{{/if}}
{{#if narrator != "Plain" || author != "off"}}
- When the style, the narrator and the author's lens pull apart, the lens wins, then the narrator, then the style.
{{/if}}
- Formatting: narration as plain text, speech in quotation marks (the ones the story language uses), a character's unspoken thoughts in *italics*. No headings, lists, notes or options inside the story.
{{#if custom}}
## The Human's own notes
{{custom}}
{{/if}}

{{#if muse == "on" || (muse == "auto" && guidance == "Guided")}}
[Muse for this reply, use it only if it fits the scene and never mention it: {{random::a sound from outside the scene that someone has to answer::a small object in reach that a character uses in an unexpected way::a want a character has kept quiet surfaces for a moment::the light, weather or temperature changes and someone feels it::someone misreads a word or a gesture, honestly::a smell or a taste brings back a specific memory::an interruption at the worst possible moment::a choice that costs something either way::a character notices a detail about the newcomer or the companion that nobody mentioned yet::a habit or ritual of the place shows itself::a joke, a tease or a flash of warmth inside the tension::the body betrays what the words hide}}.]
{{/if}}

